{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-580335115264066548 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/shieldecktopsi/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=580335104828637956&sectionId=580335115264066548)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWmsCVl95q_text","label":"ggWmsCVl95q_text","default":"Fruit Flies Took Over My Kitchen… Until I Found This 24/7 Trap That Finally Stopped Them"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_uC6iaaK5_text","label":"gg_uC6iaaK5_text","default":"<p>By <strong>Kim Fields</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVa0czNnzh_text","label":"ggVa0czNnzh_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#161723;\"><strong>Published:</strong></span> Saturday, August 16, 2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcDSZ6FTr3_text","label":"ggcDSZ6FTr3_text","default":"<p>It started with just one.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A tiny fruit fly circling the bananas on my counter. Then another.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By the end of the week, my kitchen looked like a fruit fly convention.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I cleaned. I scrubbed. I tried every internet hack—vinegar bowls, wine traps, sticky paper.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Nothing worked for long.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you’ve ever wondered “Why won’t these fruit flies go away?”, you’re not alone.</p><p>Fruit flies are one of the most common household pests, and summer makes them even worse.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They breed fast, and once they’re in your kitchen, it feels almost impossible to get rid of them.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkYmPXdOwg_text","label":"ggkYmPXdOwg_text","default":"<p>Welcome to our high quality dog food store! We are proud to bring you a range of the best dog food products, specifically designed to meet your dog's nutritional and health needs. With excellent quality and natural ingredients, our feed not only provides essential nutrition but also provides various benefits. Discover what we can do for your dog's excellent health!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkJDkejKyp_text","label":"ggkJDkejKyp_text","default":"<p>Jump to section quickly:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrauNqYB-4_text","label":"ggrauNqYB-4_text","default":"<p>Healthy and Balanced Nutrition</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGJu27KK0o_text","label":"ggGJu27KK0o_text","default":"<p>Joint Care and Mobility Support</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglltwVGTQy_text","label":"gglltwVGTQy_text","default":"<p>Digestive Health and Immune Support</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTwKF8IGAq_text","label":"ggTwKF8IGAq_text","default":"<p>Healthy Skin and Shiny Coat</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCl670EFSd_text","label":"ggCl670EFSd_text","default":"<p>Overall Well-being and Vitality</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9C8Om3SkD_text","label":"gg9C8Om3SkD_text","default":"<p>When it comes to the well-being of our furry friends, nutrition plays a vital role. As responsible pet owners, we want nothing but the best for our dogs, ensuring they live a happy and healthy life. That's why it's crucial to unleash the power of optimal nutrition, providing our beloved companions with the nourishment they deserve.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6Yi0N9UZv_text","label":"gg6Yi0N9UZv_text","default":"The Hidden Problem With Sprays and DIY Hacks"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9s0zCAsme_text","label":"gg9s0zCAsme_text","default":"<p>Like most people, I turned to quick fixes first.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Apple cider vinegar with dish soap. Sticky traps. Even those toxic sprays from the store.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But here’s the truth:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sprays leave behind chemicals right where you prep food. Sticky traps look disgusting and only catch a few at a time.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And DIY hacks? They might cut them down for a day, but then they’re back in full force.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What I didn’t realize is this: fruit flies don’t just hover around fruit. They lay eggs in drains, trash bins, and hidden cracks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unless you target the source, you’ll never truly get rid of them.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggMjMZRgH5_text","label":"gggMjMZRgH5_text","default":"The Surprising Fix I Found"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaJV_pa-kG_text","label":"ggaJV_pa-kG_text","default":"<p>After weeks of frustration, I finally cracked the code: a simple plug-in solution that works quietly in the background.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The secret?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>BuzzTrap™, a sleek device that uses UV light technology that fruit flies, gnats, and mosquitoes can’t resist.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unlike sprays or zappers, BuzzTrap™ lures pests silently with UV light—and traps them before they can spread.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No zapping sounds. No fumes. No jars of vinegar sitting on your counter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just silent, 24/7 protection.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPMspdezhy_text","label":"ggPMspdezhy_text","default":"<p>100% Chemical-Free</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaYDqt8PP2_text","label":"ggaYDqt8PP2_text","default":"<p>Safe for kitchens, pets, and kids.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFaFRdesly_text","label":"ggFaFRdesly_text","default":"<p>Fast Results&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnOJ3A_Xvx_text","label":"ggnOJ3A_Xvx_text","default":"<p>93% of users reported fewer bugs in just 3 days.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gge2tCQD5Kx_text","label":"gge2tCQD5Kx_text","default":"<p>Quiet &amp; Clean</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCd489ZtNs_text","label":"ggCd489ZtNs_text","default":"<p>No zapping sounds, no odors, no mess.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghQVrYkRkk_text","label":"gghQVrYkRkk_text","default":"<p>Instead of chasing bugs around my kitchen, the BuzzTrap worked around the clock, cutting down the fruit fly population until they disappeared completely.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Finally, a way to get rid of the buzzing—without sprays, swatters, or constant clean-ups.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx3SF5JZlT_label","label":"ggx3SF5JZlT_label","default":"Start baking doggy delights"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLbLPWWEaa_text","label":"ggLbLPWWEaa_text","default":"So How Does the BuzzTrap Work?"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpbM8fgCki_text","label":"ggpbM8fgCki_text","default":"<p>The secret behind BuzzTrap is its smart UV attraction.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fruit flies and gnats are naturally drawn to specific light wavelengths (it’s called phototaxis).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>BuzzTrap emits that irresistible UV signal. The flies head straight for it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inside, a hidden high-hold trap pad captures them. No zapping. No chemical clouds. No gross jars on your counter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For years, commercial kitchens have relied on UV light traps to help protect food areas.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>BuzzTrap brings that same proven approach into a sleek, compact device for your home.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggktNsJdlmG_text","label":"ggktNsJdlmG_text","default":"And It's Super Easy to Use!"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoY1l9J0xo_text","label":"ggoY1l9J0xo_text","default":"<p>All you do is insert the trap pad, plug in BuzzTrap™, and place it near fruit bowls, trash cans, compost bins, or sink areas.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then let it run quietly—day and night.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every week or so, check the trap. When the pad is full, swap it for a fresh one.</p><p>That’s it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No sprays. No swatters. No chasing flies around your kitchen at midnight.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just peace of mind.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDI5Y8KDVD_text","label":"ggDI5Y8KDVD_text","default":"But Does It Actually Work?"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOYaCT-a7-_text","label":"ggOYaCT-a7-_text","default":"<p>Here’s what people are saying:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJRVP1EUUi_text","label":"ggJRVP1EUUi_text","default":"Why I Love the BuzzTrap! (And Why You Should Too)"},{"type":"html","id":"ggieqLXxxDi_text","label":"ggieqLXxxDi_text","default":"<p>It’s chemical-free and safe for kitchens, pets, and kids.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It runs quietly without the loud zapping sounds of electric bug killers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It keeps the grossness out of sight—no fly graveyard hanging on your walls.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And unlike sprays or gimmicky DIY jars, BuzzTrap™ targets the actual pests that invade your home: fruit flies, drain flies, gnats, and even mosquitoes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bottom line: if you’re tired of disgusting swarms… and if you want an easy way to take your kitchen back… BuzzTrap™ is the answer.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOEWAnPiWc_label","label":"ggOEWAnPiWc_label","default":"Start baking doggy delights"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKAfeY-lct_text","label":"ggKAfeY-lct_text","default":"How Can You Try It?"},{"type":"html","id":"ggylqfpfyDv_text","label":"ggylqfpfyDv_text","default":"<p>BuzzTrap is only available online and can’t be found in stores.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now that you know how this quiet UV trap helps protect your home, here’s how to get one for yourself:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Go here and order BuzzTrap from the official website.</p><p>Plug it in and enjoy your days at home without seeing or hearing fruit flies, drain flies, or gnats.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Right now there’s a limited promotion running. If you want to check if it’s still active and inventory is in stock, click here or the link below &gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>👉 Check Current Availability »</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguz3sVQaNo_text","label":"gguz3sVQaNo_text","default":"First-Time Buyers: Get 33% Off - Stock's Low"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWRAHWLHHh_text","label":"ggWRAHWLHHh_text","default":"<p>10,000+ Verified 5-Star Reviews</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQh5NC5cTR_text","label":"ggQh5NC5cTR_text","default":"<p>This Offer is Not Available on Amazon.</p><p>(Discount Only Available While Supplies Last)</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWZ989EdWo_label","label":"ggWZ989EdWo_label","default":"<p>GET 33% DISCOUNT</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVArO41QY5_text","label":"ggVArO41QY5_text","default":"30-Day Satisfaction Guarantee"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvTkfSyWVg_text","label":"ggvTkfSyWVg_text","default":"<p>When your package arrives, give it a try for 30 days.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you’re not 100% satisfied for any reason whatsoever, just let us know and we’ll quickly handle your return.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No questions asked.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtV5GEOgjE_text","label":"ggtV5GEOgjE_text","default":"<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_0","label":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_0","default":"<p>Can Petpure plate be used on a regular basis?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_1","label":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_1","default":"<p>Can Petpure plate be given to pregnant &amp; nursing dogs?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_2","label":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_2","default":"<p>Will my dog like the taste?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_3","label":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_3","default":"<p>How long will it take to see results?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_4","label":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_4","default":"<p>How does the money back guarantee work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_5","label":"ggAoGuM-05t_childItem_5","default":"<p>Any further questions?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFy-VJFLPP_text","label":"ggFy-VJFLPP_text","default":"<p>Yes, Petpure Plate delivers its unique health benefits when given daily and long term.<br>They are also available on a simple subscription which will save you time and money.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFjus5qEAa_text","label":"ggFjus5qEAa_text","default":"<p>Yes, they are suitable for both nursing and pregant dogs.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQDLGXe2Xg_text","label":"ggQDLGXe2Xg_text","default":"<p>Made from all-natural ingredients, this flavouring is allergen-free, contains no artificial nasties and is 100% safe for canine consumption. Your dog will love the chicken and bacon flavour, too!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3-Ro0b3P6_text","label":"gg3-Ro0b3P6_text","default":"<p>When taken on a regular daily basis, most dogs will begin to show results within around 6 weeks. However, after the first 30 days, you may start to notice your dog's gut and digestive health appear healthy and normal.From month 3 onwards, continued use has never been more important. By following the correct directions and regular use, you'll be able to make sure your pup's gut and digestion stays healthy.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggABK90cH_x_text","label":"ggABK90cH_x_text","default":"<p>You can shop with peace of mind, in fact we’re so confident you’ll love our products that if not, we'll offer you a 30 day money back guarantee.<br>If you’re unhappy with your Buddy &amp; Lola purchase, please email us at Support@gempet.com</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6bTABQyvk_text","label":"gg6bTABQyvk_text","default":"<p>If you haven't found the answer to your query in the above FAQs we have further information about Super Tummy Daily Chews available in our <u>Help Center</u>.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggD8qsYzRKX_text","label":"ggD8qsYzRKX_text","default":"<p>Hurry up! Sale <span style=\"color:#EA3335;\">33%</span>. Sale ends in:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUMtN46nIr_dayLabel","label":"ggUMtN46nIr_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUMtN46nIr_hourLabel","label":"ggUMtN46nIr_hourLabel","default":"Hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUMtN46nIr_minuteLabel","label":"ggUMtN46nIr_minuteLabel","default":"Mins"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUMtN46nIr_secondLabel","label":"ggUMtN46nIr_secondLabel","default":"Secs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUMtN46nIr_weekLabel","label":"ggUMtN46nIr_weekLabel","default":"Weeks"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVHpnGOJnz_childItem_0","label":"ggVHpnGOJnz_childItem_0","default":"<p>Bug-free comfort you can feel</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVHpnGOJnz_childItem_1","label":"ggVHpnGOJnz_childItem_1","default":"<p>No harsh sprays or toxic fumes</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVHpnGOJnz_childItem_2","label":"ggVHpnGOJnz_childItem_2","default":"<p>Safer spaces for your family</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4HETOKAMB_label","label":"gg4HETOKAMB_label","default":"Check Availability"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJqM7vWmwy_childItem_0","label":"ggJqM7vWmwy_childItem_0","default":"<p>30-day money back guarantee</p>"}],
